msgid "Deals fire damage with a potency of 350 to target and all enemies nearby it.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Mudra Combination:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Chi</ui-edge-color></ui-color>→<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Ten</ui-edge-color></ui-color> or <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Jin</ui-edge-color></ui-color>→<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Ten</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Triggers the cooldown of weaponskills, mudra, and <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Ninjutsu</ui-edge-color></ui-color> upon execution.<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar.<br>※<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Ninjutsu</ui-edge-color></ui-color> changes to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Katon</ui-edge-color></ui-color> when requirements for execution are met."
