msgid "Delivers an attack to all enemies in a straight line before you.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Combo Action: </ui-edge-color></ui-color><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Sonic Thrust</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Combo Potency: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>1,200<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Combo Bonus: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Extends <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Blood of the Dragon</ui-edge-color></ui-color> or <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Life of the Dragon</ui-edge-color></ui-color> duration by 10s, to a maximum of 30s<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
